 /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T18:53:11-08:00","id":3926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/2621-so-has-the-game-been-released-yet?p=3924#post3924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I understand the kickstarter is going to be about the deluxe addition as well as other things.</div> </div> </div> </div>According to the blog, it's &quot;Prestige Edition&quot;. And goes to KS for approval on Wednesday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/210-siven","name":"Siven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T06:16:32-08:00","id":4248,"title":"","content":"I attended LA By Night and played in the Wrecking Crews Demo of Demon. All I can say is that this game is going to be a massive hit. I have not been this excited for a new game since Changeling the Lost came out.<br /> <br /> I plan on contributing to the KS no doubt. Just curious what featues the prestige edition will have. If its anything like the Mummy deluxe then Im sold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T06:31:12-08:00","id":4259,"title":"","content":"Demon is definitely going to be the first Kickstarter I ever fund. I haven't been this excited by what a game can do since the first time I read Changeling: the Lost.<br /> <br /> I just want it to come out already!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T07:20:40-08:00","id":4290,"title":"","content":"I feel ya. I just saw the proofs (and picked through them, putting in page numbers), and the book is looking really slick. Players Guide is looking to be fun, too, but let's not get ahead of ourselves. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T08:22:56-08:00","id":4338,"title":"","content":"I have to say, I like how &quot;Prestige Edition&quot; sounds. I feel like an echo in the wind here but, yeah. I'm going to pour so much money into that kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T07:11:00-08:00","id":5045,"title":"","content":"So this is totally me right now with this book...<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IrCEhRNgGHY\" data-code=\"IrCEhRNgGHY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IrCEhRNgGHY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">At the end of the day, what works in <b>YOUR</b> story with <b>YOUR</b> players is what matters most. Not what someone on some forum says.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/328-phoenixfire","name":"PhoenixFire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar328_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T10:02:36-08:00","id":5179,"title":"","content":"Isn't the Kickstarter one 'okay' away from being launched..?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T15:22:09-08:00","id":5472,"title":"","content":"As far as we know its waiting on an okay from the party least invested in hurrying things along. That is we are waiting on Kickstarter; for them its just a project in the approval que.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>J. T. Legal</b><br /> The other kind of rules lawyer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/334-technocratjt","name":"TechnocratJT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar334_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T17:21:41-08:00","id":5596,"title":"","content":"What's the wait time for approval of these Kickstarters so that we can plan ahead?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T21:11:56-08:00","id":5717,"title":"","content":"I don't want a fancy edition, but I am looking forward to the regular release. I was very pleased with the quality of the Mummy book, even without the bells and whistles. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kismet's <a href=\"http://www.wod.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WOD</a> - <a href=\"http://www.dnd.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">D&amp;D</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BoundinDreams\" target=\"_blank\">C:tL</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheNamelessEmpire\" target=\"_blank\">M:tC</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/227-kismetrose","name":"KismetRose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-08T07:17:05-08:00","id":5888,"title":"","content":"I picked up the Mummy Deluxe and really am very happy with it. If its anything like what they have planned for Demon I'll KS for it (really only comes up to the price of a regularly published book, or about $35-40). That said, it would be nice if they continue with the pledge tiers granting access to contributors to get the preview PDF like they did for Mummy, certainly makes it an incentive for the KS.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T10:49:14-08:00","id":6919,"title":"","content":"The quickstart is awesome, and I look forward to getting my hands on the big book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T10:33:30-08:00","id":8205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JoeB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/2621-so-has-the-game-been-released-yet?p=4248#post4248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I attended LA By Night and played in the Wrecking Crews Demo of Demon. All I can say is that this game is going to be a massive hit. I have not been this excited for a new game since Changeling the Lost came out.<br /> <br /> I plan on contributing to the KS no doubt. Just curious what featues the prestige edition will have. If its anything like the Mummy deluxe then Im sold.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am sad I missed going to LAbN and thus missed a chance to actually play Demon for once as opposed to running it. Well, that and seeing friends I don't get to see often.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T11:24:06-08:00","id":8255,"title":"","content":"At the edge of my seat.<br /> <br /> Maybe I can use that embed, I mean, there COULD be a Demon corebook in my pocket, possibly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T11:30:58-08:00","id":8262,"title":"","content":"Just in case anyone missed it:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/demon-prestige-kickstarter-24-hour-warning/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/demon-prestige-kickstarter-24-hour-warning/\" target=\"_blank\"> Demon Prestige Kickstarter: 24 hour warning! &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/demon-prestige-kickstarter-24-hour-warning/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/demon-prestige-kickstarter-24-hour-warning/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Kickstarter launches tomorrow at noon Eastern.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;